{"event": "agent", "step": 183, "message": {"type": "bug_report", "screen": "Shop > Sell > Sell Old Gear sheet and per-item sell panel (Keep one of each item OFF)", "element": "Iron Sword row (equipped, ×1 in inventory)", "element_ref": 20, "field": "sellable quantity of a single spare copy", "symptom_type": "wrong_value", "expected": "Two items with the same inventory count (×1) and the same toggle state (OFF) should offer the same sellable quantity. Bronze Dagger ×1 (not equipped) is offered: 1 sellable, 25 coins. Iron Sword ×1 in inventory (equipped copy also owned) should be offered the same way, 1 sellable, 62 coins, and appear in Sell Old Gear.", "observed": "With the toggle OFF, Sell Old Gear lists Bronze Dagger ×1 (25) but omits Iron Sword (its only inventory copy is ×1 \"in inventory\", plus an equipped copy). The Iron Sword row still shows \"×1 in inventory\" and \"62 coins ea.\". The total is 5,267 with nine rows; Iron Sword contributes nothing. Earlier, Iron Sword ×3 and ×2 were also reduced by one, so the spare is held back regardless of the toggle.", "observed_quote": "Iron Sword | (equipped) | ×1 in inventory | 62 coins ea.", "steps": ["Starting data: Iron Sword equipped; inventory Iron Sword ×1 after earlier sales. Keep one of each item is OFF.", "Shop > Sell. Confirm Bronze Dagger shows \"×1 in inventory\" and Iron Sword shows \"(equipped)\" and \"×1 in inventory\".", "Tap Bronze Dagger row: panel \"Sell: Bronze Dagger\" offers 1 (25 coins).", "Tap Sell Old Gear: list has nine rows including Bronze Dagger ×1 (25); Iron Sword is absent. Total 5,267.", "Tap the Iron Sword row: no quantity control is offered (0 sellable)."], "anchor_node": {"class": "android.view.View", "contains": ["Iron Sword", "(equipped)", "×1 in inventory", "62 coins ea."], "bounds": [0, 1487, 1080, 1630]}}}
